      "html" : "<\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-178376\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-178376\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div>Installation and testing of deep foundation elements shall be subject to special inspections as specified in <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '\/codes\/newyorkcity\/latest\/NYCadmin\/0-0-0-224367', hash: '#JD_BCTable1705.7' }}\">Table 1705.7<\/Link>. The approved geotechnical report and construction documents prepared by the registered design professionals shall be used to determine compliance. A special inspector shall be present during the installation and testing of each deep foundation element. The frequency shall be in accordance with the frequency specified in <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '\/codes\/newyorkcity\/latest\/NYCadmin\/0-0-0-224367', hash: '#JD_BCTable1705.7' }}\">Tables 1705.7<\/Link>, <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '\/codes\/newyorkcity\/latest\/NYCadmin\/0-0-0-178379', hash: '#JD_BCTable1705.7.1' }}\">1705.7.1<\/Link>, <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '\/codes\/newyorkcity\/latest\/NYCadmin\/0-0-0-178383', hash: '#JD_BCTable1705.7.2' }}\">1705.7.2<\/Link> and <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '\/codes\/newyorkcity\/latest\/NYCadmin\/0-0-0-178387', hash: '#JD_BCTable1705.7.3' }}\">1705.7.3<\/Link>, as applicable. Submittal of records of special inspections required by this section shall be in accordance with Section 1705.7.5.<\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-178377\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-178377\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div><a name=\"JD_BCTable1705.7\" id=\"JD_BCTable1705.7\" title=\"BC Table 1705.7\"><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Table 1705.7<br><\/br>Required Special Inspections and Tests of Deep Foundation Elements<\/span><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-178378\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-178378\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div>",
